                "metadata": {
                    "description": "Finn Copperpot, the inventive fox, is always building gadgets to solve everyday problems. His latest creation, the Mist-o-Matic 3000, is meant to water his garden with the perfect mist. But when Finn flips the switch, things don’t go quite as planned—water sprays everywhere, turning his yard into a surprise splash zone! With neighbors gathering and water flying, can Finn figure out how to get his invention back on track?",
